cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
type: software
title: "CONFIGURE v1.2: Cost-benefit Optimisation Framework for Implementing blue-Green infrastructURE (detention ponds)"
version: 1.2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Ur Rehman
    given-names: Asid
    affiliation: Newcastle University
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/asidurrehman/Configure12"
abstract: >-
  CONFIGURE couples the NSGA-II multi-objective genetic algorithm with the
  CityCAT hydrodynamic flood model. Version 1.2 optimises the location and size
  of detention ponds against pond life cycle cost and Expected Annual Damage
  for multiple rainfall return periods.
keywords:
  - flood risk management
  - blue-green infrastructure
  - detention ponds
  - multi-objective optimisation
  - NSGA-II
  - CityCAT
